The tenant seccomp allowlist derives from Docker/Moby 29.8.2 and
github.com/moby/profiles/seccomp v0.2.3, licensed under Apache License 2.0.
The unmodified profile, matching license, source pin and the quota-protection
modifications are included in bananawiki/ops/seccomp.

The container images include FFmpeg 9.0.2, licensed under LGPL 2.1 or later,
and Debian's LAME library, licensed under LGPL 2.0 or later. Their source,
configuration, licenses and redistribution instructions are included in each
image at /usr/local/share/bananawiki/media. The FFmpeg build recipe and release
verification files are in docker/media in the source repository.

The container images also update the LGPL 2.1-or-later ACL library using
authenticated Debian packages, with a compatible GPL 3-or-later GNU tar.
Their source, license and publisher-verification records, and corresponding
GNU coreutils source, are included at /usr/local/share/bananawiki/acl.
